      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Mobile Metronome for Android Version 1.2.4F (2012) Developed by Gabriel Simoes http://gabrielsimoes.blogspot.com Logo design by Lila Farias liladesigner@gmail.com Please, send comments, feature requests or report bugs to: mobilemetronome@gmail.com This app is ad-supported so you can have it for free. Also, ad-support allows its continuous improvement over time. You can also buy an ads-free and more complete version from the Android Market by clicking on \"Buy PRO version!\" from the menu. About permissions: Mobile Metronome uses 5 different permissions: - INTERNET and ACCESS NETWORK STATE are required for ad-support. - ACCESS COARSE LOCATION helps displaying advertisement which is relevant in your location. - READ PHONE STATE allows Mobile Metronome to stop automaticaly when there's an incoming call. - WAKE LOCK garantees the metronome won't stop after screen goes off. Mobile Metronome DOES NOT access any personal info, including your phone number or personal contacts list.",
